"line-accent\">10841</span></div> <div class=\"t-line-dim\">Cancer vs. cancer-"
"free accuracy: <span class=\"t-line-accent\">98%%</span></div> <div>Stage "
"inference accuracy: <span class=\"t-line-accent\">67,8%%</span><span "
"class=\"t-cursor\"></span></div>"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"t-line-dim\">Dataset: <span class=\"t-line-accent\">200GB</"
"span> profili di metilazione</div> <div>Campioni processati: <span class=\"t-"
"line-accent\">10841</span></div> <div class=\"t-line-dim\">Accuratezza "
"tumore SÌ/NO: <span class=\"t-line-accent\">98%%</span></div> "
"<div>Accuratezza inferenza stadio: <span class=\"t-line-accent\">67,8%%</"
"span><span class=\"t-cursor\"></span></div>"

